      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly, the \"support\" part just feels like more work. another person to explain this to, another person to perform for. i'm just so tired of fighting to stay present in a life that doesn't even feel like mine anymore. sometimes i think the only thing that would actually feel peaceful is if everything just... stopped. if the quiet finally stayed.",
